This mod bundles no third-party source code. It reads files written by,
and is run alongside, third-party software the consumer installs
separately:

  * Claude Code — Anthropic
    https://claude.com/claude-code
    The mod runs inside Claude Code's mods engine and is typed against
    its `claude-code` declarations, which are not redistributed here.

  * HCF (plan-create / plan-orchestrate) — Mark Shust
    https://github.com/markshust/hcf  (MIT)
    The mod reads the plan files HCF writes. No HCF code is included.

  * Playwright — Microsoft
    https://github.com/microsoft/playwright  (Apache-2.0)
    The bundled reporter implements Playwright's Reporter interface and
    is loaded by the consumer's own Playwright install. No Playwright
    code is included.
